stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> none : platform added to article

  none --> pending : POST /api/articles/{id}/push (job running)
  pending --> draft : push job done (draft created on platform)
  pending --> error : push job error (auth failure, rate limit, etc.)

  draft --> pending : re-push triggered
  error --> pending : retry push

  draft --> published : platform publishes the draft (external action)
  published --> [*]